Here's an example of how you could modify your code to find equities where the document does not have "annual_report_filename" and does have field "Type" equal to "Common Stock":
```
major_equities = equities_collection.find(
    {"$or": [
        {"annual_report_filename": {"$does_not_exist": True}},
        {"Type": {"$ne": "Common Stock"}}
